              "id": "hatching:1q4w2v3:sod7f1",
              "html": "The two TzHaar will also fire occasionally. Keep an eye on them as both may shoot fire spells at the egg simultaneously which could result in overheating.",
              "text": "The two TzHaar will also fire occasionally. Keep an eye on them as both may shoot fire spells at the egg simultaneously which could result in overheating.",
